{
  "title": "102: al-Takaasor التكاثر",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM.\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-beneficent, the All-merciful\nاَلْهٰٮكُمُ التَّكَاثُرُۙ‏(1)\nALHAAKOMUT TAKAASORO.\nRivalry [and vainglory] distracted you\nحَتّٰى زُرْتُمُ الْمَقَابِرَؕ‏(2)\nHATTA ZURTOMUL MAQAABER.\nuntil you visited [even] the graves.\nكَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَۙ‏(3)\nKALLAA SAWFA TA’LAMOONA.\nNo indeed, soon you will know!\nثُمَّ كَلَّا سَوْفَ تَعْلَمُوْنَؕ‏(4)\nSUMMA KALLAA SAWFA TA’LAMOON.\nNo indeed, soon you will know for yet another time!\nكَلَّا لَوْ تَعْلَمُوْنَ عِلْمَ الْيَقِيْنِؕ‏(5)\nKALLAA LAW TA’LAMOONA I’LMAL YAQEEN.\nIndeed, were you to know with certain knowledge,\nلَتَرَوُنَّ الْجَحِيْمَۙ‏(6)\nLA-TARA-WUNNAL JAHEEM.\nyou would have surely seen hell [in this very life].\nثُمَّ لَتَرَوُنَّهَا عَيْنَ الْيَقِيْنِۙ‏(7)\nSUMMA LA-TA-RAWUNNAHAA A’YNAL YAQEEN.\nAfterward you will surely see it with the eye of certainty.\nثُمَّ لَتُسْئَلُنَّ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَنِ النَّعِيْمِ‏(8)\nSUMMA LA-TUS-A-LUNNA YAWMA-EZIN A’NIN NA-E’EM.\nThen, on that day, you will surely be questioned concerning the Blessing.",
  "merits": "This Surah has 8 verses and it was revealed in Makkah. The Holy Prophet (s.a.w.a.) said that whoever recites this Surah before going to sleep at night will be saved from the torments of the grave. If this Surah is recited in obligatory prayers, the reciter will get the reward of a hundred martyrs. If recited in the nawafil prayers, he will get the reward of fifty martyrs.\nIt is especially recommended to recite Surah al-Takaasor in the ‘Asr prayers and the person who does this remains under the protection of Allah until the day ends. Recitation of this Surah is a cure from headaches. Another way of reciting salaat al-Wahshat (apart from the commonly known way) is to recite Ayatul Kursi once and [Surah al-Ikhlaas](A116) twice after the al-Hamd of the first rak’aat and then recite Surah al-Takaasor ten times after the al-Hamd of the second rak’aat."
